fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/skills/agent-browser/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>automation-workflows</name>\n    <description>Design and implement automation workflows to save time and scale operations as a solopreneur. Use when identifying repetitive tasks to automate, building workflows across tools, setting up triggers and actions, or optimizing existing automations. Covers automation opportunity identification, workflow design, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), testing, and maintenance. Trigger on &quot;automate&quot;, &quot;automation&quot;, &quot;workflow automation&quot;, &quot;save time&quot;, &quot;reduce manual work&quot;, &quot;automate my business&quot;, &quot;no-code automation&quot;.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/skills/automation-workflows/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>binance-hunter</name>\n    <description>The Hunter: Professional Binance Trading Skill. Features AI market analysis, auto-risk calculation, and 125x leverage support.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/binance-hunter/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>Blockchain</name>\n    <description>Understand blockchain technology, interact with smart contracts, and evaluate when distributed ledgers solve real problems.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/blockchain/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>EnvGuard Secret &amp; Credential Scanner</name>\n    <description>Scan repos and workspaces for leaked secrets. API keys in code, passwords in configs, tokens in logs. Catches them before they hit git.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/skills/env-guard/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>explain-code</name>\n    <description>用可视化图表和类比解释代码。在解释代码如何工作、教授代码库或用户询问如何工作时使用</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/explain-code/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>feishu-doc</name>\n    <description>Feishu document read/write operations. Activate when user mentions Feishu docs, cloud docs, or docx links.</description>\n    <location>/app/dist/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>feishu-drive</name>\n    <description>Feishu cloud storage file management. Activate when user mentions cloud space, folders, drive.</description>\n    <location>/app/dist/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-drive/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>feishu-perm</name>\n    <description>Feishu permission management for documents and files. Activate when user mentions sharing, permissions, collaborators.</description>\n    <location>/app/dist/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-perm/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>feishu-wiki</name>\n    <description>Feishu knowledge base navigation. Activate when user mentions knowledge base, wiki, or wiki links.</description>\n    <location>/app/dist/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-wiki/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>find-skills</name>\n    <description>Search and discover OpenClaw skills from various sources. Use when: user wants to find available skills, search for specific functionality, or discover new skills to install.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/skills/find-skills-skill/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>freeride</name>\n    <description>Manages free AI models from OpenRouter for OpenClaw. Automatically ranks models by quality, configures fallbacks for rate-limit handling, and updates openclaw.json. Use when the user mentions free AI, OpenRouter, model switching, rate limits, or wants to reduce AI costs.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/skills/free-ride-1-0-5/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>github</name>\n    <description>Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `