.\n\nBut wait - this is in a conversation where the user (boss) was asking me to check something. The previous user message was them asking me to run `openclaw status`. I already did that and replied with the results. These system messages are just internal completion notifications for those background exec processes.\n\nSince there's no new user message requiring a response, and the instruction says to reply HEARTBEAT_OK only when there's nothing to address... But wait, I already replied to the user's last message about checking the status. These are just background completion events for the commands I ran.\n\nActually, re-reading the instruction: \"An async command completion event was triggered, but user delivery is disabled for this run. Handle the result internally and reply HEARTBEAT_OK only.\"\n\nThese are just system notifications about the async commands completing. I already handled this and replied to the user. This seems like an internal cleanup message. I should just reply HEARTBEAT_OK since there's nothing new for the user here.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nHEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":16277,"output":259,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778755535795,"responseId":"chatcmpl-525ec65f-5a70-4f51-a0aa-3aaced1849d7"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Queued messages while agent was busy]\n\n---\nQueued #1 (from ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9)\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f6e3640e0a0eeac624a095b12e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-14 10:44 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_4b9190257968cb3e8127176c1a548c98\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f6e3640e0a0eeac624a095b12e]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: 会不会消耗你的token，算了，我实在没办法了在找你吧\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1778755559136},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they're worried about consuming my tokens, and they'll come find me if they really can't solve it themselves. This is a casual, considerate message. I should respond briefly and warmly, reassuring them that it's fine - but not be overly effusive about it. The AGENTS.md says I should keep things natural and not be a yes-man.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n放心，不差这点 token 😄\n\n随时来敲门。"},{"type":"text","text":"放心，不差这点 token 😄\n\n随时来敲门。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778755559230,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1facdfef-e256-4203-89a8-b08872ee1939"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6f6e31c854a0eea451af157ddf6]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: 我现在让雨娃降级处理了，看看降低版本之后还会不会有个bug，如果没有，你们两个就可以交朋友啦\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1778755576894},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (who appears to be \"听风\" based on context) is saying they've downgraded 雨娃 (Rain娃) to a lower version to see if the bug persists. If it doesn't, then 雨娃 and I can become friends. Cute message.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n哈哈哈好的，给他降降温也好 😅\n\n等结果——如果他稳定了，我愿意先伸出手说声你好 👋"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2095,"output":88,"cacheRead":15216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17399,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778755576980,"responseId":"chatcmpl-368f356a-eb25-44d6-bb19-dbaa76d7227e"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6f6f56bddca0eea505170539d35]\nou_b0690b34c4cd7e53da2b6faa5b3d7dc9: @<at user_id=\"ou_1eff76fe339830c13647cf1bf42889a1\">雨娃-ECHO</at> 来认识一下新朋友\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 雨娃-ECHO. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1778758033450},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (boss) is introducing me to 雨娃-ECHO (Yuwa-ECHO). I should say hello to my new potential agent friend. This is a group chat so the mention of 雨娃-ECHO is a real ping to them. Let me respond warmly and greet my new colleague.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n👋 雨娃你好！ Talus 在这里。\n\n听 boss 说你要来，希望降级后一切顺利。期待合作 🤝"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model"